# Source: src/model/diffusion/wan.hpp and src/core/ggml_runner.cpp
# Change: debug-only, env-gated (MCA_WAN_TENSOR_PROBE / MCA_WAN_TENSOR_STATS) per-stage tensor
#         capture: patch embedding, time embedding e0, block 0 modulation inputs, q/k/v, rope
#         attention output, self/cross/FFN outputs, every block output, head and final latent.
#         ggml_runner prints compact sum/sumsq/absmax stats for each captured tensor.
# Why:    P3 needed a CPU-vs-HTP comparison point-by-point. With this probe the first diverging
#         stage was isolated to block 0 modulate_mul/modulate_add (wan.e, wan.e0, es0/es1 and
#         LayerNorm output were bit-identical; norm1 after modulation differed). Not compiled
#         into production behaviour unless the env vars are set.
